WEBVTT

00:00:03.410 --> 00:00:05.390
<i>Spring. Cherry blossoms.</i>

00:00:05.390 --> 00:00:08.240
<i>Bush warblers. Hay fever.</i>

00:00:07.880 --> 00:00:09.440
<b>Seton
 Academy</b>

00:00:07.880 --> 00:00:09.440
<b>Seton Academy
Entrance
 Ceremony</b>

00:00:08.240 --> 00:00:09.440
<i>And...</i>

00:00:09.440 --> 00:00:09.960
<b>En</b>

00:00:09.960 --> 00:00:10.460
<b>trance</b>

00:00:10.460 --> 00:00:11.070
<b>Ceremony</b>

00:00:11.070 --> 00:00:14.070
<b>Seton Academy
Entrance Ceremony</b>

00:00:11.650 --> 00:00:14.070
<i>School entrance ceremonies! 
All signs of the new season.</i>

00:00:33.820 --> 00:00:35.510
Come on, you guys!

00:00:37.600 --> 00:00:39.580
You're all a bunch of animals!

00:00:37.780 --> 00:00:39.060
<b>Humans are the most skilled throwers of all mammals</b>

00:00:42.640 --> 00:00:43.890
Oh, crap!

00:01:04.660 --> 00:01:05.750
Hey!

00:01:07.560 --> 00:01:09.180
All right, brats...

00:01:07.560 --> 00:01:13.260
<b>Seton Academy Teacher        Terano-sensei 
Tyrannosaurus Rex</b>

00:01:09.660 --> 00:01:13.260
Line up, or I'll eat every last one of you!

00:01:16.140 --> 00:01:21.060
Now, the headmaster would like 
to address all the new students.

00:01:21.060 --> 00:01:24.310
Headmaster, if you please.

00:01:24.310 --> 00:01:28.270
Well, everyone, today is—

00:01:24.350 --> 00:01:27.540
<b>Seton Academy Headmaster                    Amano-sensei 
Anomalocaris</b>

00:01:28.940 --> 00:01:29.980
Headmaster!

00:01:32.660 --> 00:01:34.360
W-Water! Water!

00:01:34.820 --> 00:01:35.650
Ow!

00:01:35.650 --> 00:01:36.790
Ow!

00:01:36.790 --> 00:01:37.780
You, child...

00:01:37.780 --> 00:01:40.780
Water... Please fetch some water!

00:01:43.050 --> 00:01:44.910
Why?!

00:01:45.220 --> 00:01:48.920
Don't fetch me! I asked you to fetch water!

00:01:49.990 --> 00:01:52.040
This is why I can't stand animals.

00:01:52.040 --> 00:01:54.000
No! Stop!

00:01:54.330 --> 00:01:57.010
Oh, I'm done for!

00:02:06.540 --> 00:02:11.020
<b>Join the Pack!</b>

00:02:08.460 --> 00:02:11.060
<b>Seton Academy</b>

00:02:31.900 --> 00:02:32.630
<b>Unnatural interspecies relations are strictly forbidden!!</b>

00:02:42.340 --> 00:02:42.640
<b>Miyubi: Dead</b>

00:03:28.020 --> 00:03:32.980
<i>This is a school for animals, where all
 sorts of animals live together.</i>

00:03:32.980 --> 00:03:36.730
<i>It is a sacred cage where constant 
battles between species</i>

00:03:36.730 --> 00:03:42.590
<i>foster a spirit of survival of 
the fittest in all students,</i>

00:03:42.590 --> 00:03:43.740
<i>and it is called...</i>

00:03:43.740 --> 00:03:46.850
<i>Seton Academy!</i>

00:03:43.740 --> 00:03:47.220
<b>Seton Academy</b>

00:03:43.740 --> 00:03:49.250
<b>Seton
 Academy</b>

00:03:49.250 --> 00:03:50.750
<b>Seton Academy Record 1     Ranka the Wolf Boss</b>

00:03:50.750 --> 00:03:52.250
Chow time!

00:03:54.000 --> 00:03:54.980
<b>Animal Weaknesses</b>

00:04:04.620 --> 00:04:06.970
<i>His name is Mazama Jin.</i>

00:04:06.970 --> 00:04:10.140
<i>He's a new first-year here at Seton Academy.</i>

00:04:10.140 --> 00:04:12.290
<i>He is a primate of the species </i>Homo sapiens<i>,</i>

00:04:12.290 --> 00:04:14.260
<i>or in other words, a human.</i>

00:04:14.260 --> 00:04:16.590
<i>I hope all you stupid animals go extinct!</i>

00:04:17.030 --> 00:04:19.790
<i>He hates animals with a passion.</i>

00:04:19.780 --> 00:04:21.530
<b>Cafeteria</b>

00:04:24.230 --> 00:04:25.450
Hurry it up!

00:04:25.450 --> 00:04:26.750
You're holding up the line!

00:04:26.120 --> 00:04:28.620
<b>Raw Meat</b>

00:04:26.120 --> 00:04:28.620
<b>Grass</b>

00:04:26.120 --> 00:04:28.620
<b>Bugs</b>

00:04:26.120 --> 00:04:28.620
<b>Raw Fish</b>

00:04:26.120 --> 00:04:28.620
<b>Leaves</b>

00:04:26.120 --> 00:04:28.620
<b>Water</b>

00:04:27.680 --> 00:04:28.620
<b>Meal Tickets</b>

00:04:28.620 --> 00:04:30.030
Excuse me.

00:04:30.030 --> 00:04:31.000
Yep?

00:04:31.000 --> 00:04:32.500
Dressing on the grass, please.

00:04:31.220 --> 00:04:32.500
<b>Raw Meat</b>

00:04:31.220 --> 00:04:32.500
<b>Grass</b>

00:04:32.850 --> 00:04:34.570
If you don't have any, at least put salt on it.

00:04:34.570 --> 00:04:36.960
And... please cook the meat!

00:04:36.960 --> 00:04:39.630
Cook it? Why?

00:04:43.410 --> 00:04:44.510
Damn it!

00:04:46.810 --> 00:04:49.220
<i>I'll just try to tuck myself away in a corner.</i>

00:04:55.390 --> 00:04:58.650
<i>It's that dumb dog from the entrance ceremony!</i>

00:04:58.650 --> 00:05:02.990
<i>It is extremely dangerous to carelessly 
approach an animal that is eating.</i>

00:05:02.990 --> 00:05:07.350
<i>Carnivores, in particular. If they 
think their prey is about to be stolen...</i>

00:05:08.650 --> 00:05:10.410
<i>They will become very threatening.</i>

00:05:12.080 --> 00:05:15.090
<i>The best course of action is 
not to panic and run away,</i>

00:05:15.090 --> 00:05:18.850
<i>but to avert your eyes, expressing that
 you don't want to fight.</i>

00:05:19.540 --> 00:05:20.840
<i>This calms them down.</i>

00:05:21.330 --> 00:05:24.300
<i>But they will still be wary 
as long as you're nearby,</i>

00:05:22.770 --> 00:05:24.300
Stare...

00:05:22.770 --> 00:05:24.300
<b>Stare</b>

00:05:24.720 --> 00:05:27.910
<i>so the fastest way to make peace is...</i>

00:05:27.910 --> 00:05:28.720
Here.

00:05:30.570 --> 00:05:32.810
<i>This wins them over instantly!</i>

00:05:37.020 --> 00:05:38.620
<i>Stupid animal...</i>

00:05:43.930 --> 00:05:45.360
I'm gonna...

00:05:45.360 --> 00:05:47.360
let you join my pack!

00:05:47.940 --> 00:05:48.740
Huh?

00:05:48.740 --> 00:05:53.060
I'm Ranka the wolf, boss of
 the proud wolf clan!

00:05:53.060 --> 00:05:56.000
I'll show you to my territory! Follow me!

00:05:57.120 --> 00:05:59.120
Hey, hey, hey! Aren't you happy?

00:05:59.120 --> 00:06:00.920
Huh? Huh? Huh? You can join my pack!

00:06:00.920 --> 00:06:02.670
Hey! Hey! Hey! Hey! Hey! Hey! Hey!

00:06:02.670 --> 00:06:03.610
Hey!

00:06:05.140 --> 00:06:07.690
<i>Canines rely on their sense 
of smell to survive,</i>

00:06:07.690 --> 00:06:10.840
<i>so when presented with 
any object, they have to sniff it.</i>

00:06:10.840 --> 00:06:11.650
Go!

00:06:14.170 --> 00:06:15.410
Now's my chance to—

00:06:15.410 --> 00:06:17.500
May I sit next to you?

00:06:18.270 --> 00:06:19.490
Look, I... don't...

00:06:21.270 --> 00:06:24.780
You're Mazama Jin-kun, right?

00:06:21.310 --> 00:06:24.780
<b>Hino Hitomi 
Primate: <i>Homo sapiens</i></b>

00:06:24.780 --> 00:06:26.690
Are you done eating already?

00:06:27.510 --> 00:06:28.530
No, no!

00:06:28.530 --> 00:06:31.940
I'm still just starting. Go ahead, have a seat.

00:06:31.940 --> 00:06:33.120
Oh, good!

00:06:33.620 --> 00:06:37.120
You and I are the only humans here,
 so I felt a little lost.

00:06:37.120 --> 00:06:39.000
<i>I'm so glad I'm human!</i>

00:06:40.850 --> 00:06:42.880
You brought lunch from home, Hino-san?

00:06:42.880 --> 00:06:45.420
Yeah. I really like to cook.

00:06:45.420 --> 00:06:48.820
And the menu here is a little too wild for me.

00:06:48.820 --> 00:06:50.130
Yeah, considering this...

00:06:53.310 --> 00:06:55.510
<i>S-She's soothing my soul.</i>

00:06:55.510 --> 00:06:57.660
<i>What could be better than this?</i>

00:06:57.660 --> 00:07:01.020
<i>Random, vague conversations, 
peaceful times...</i>

00:07:01.360 --> 00:07:06.110
<i>I wish all these animals would go 
extinct and leave the two of us here.</i>

00:07:09.280 --> 00:07:11.750
There's a strange female here!

00:07:11.750 --> 00:07:13.880
Is this a friend of yours, Jin-kun?

00:07:13.880 --> 00:07:14.700
No, no...

00:07:14.700 --> 00:07:15.710
Hey!

00:07:15.710 --> 00:07:18.730
If you want this male, 
you'll have to fight me for him!

00:07:18.730 --> 00:07:19.620
H-Huh?

00:07:19.620 --> 00:07:21.420
Bring it, human female!

00:07:21.420 --> 00:07:24.790
Excuse me! I'm not a "male"! I'm Mazama Jin!

00:07:24.790 --> 00:07:26.640
What are you doing to Hino-san?!

00:07:26.640 --> 00:07:28.130
Sorry!

00:07:28.130 --> 00:07:30.710
I guess I was interfering!

00:07:30.710 --> 00:07:32.380
Hino-san!

00:07:32.380 --> 00:07:34.890
Aw, man...

00:07:36.050 --> 00:07:37.140
I win!

00:07:36.200 --> 00:07:37.140
<b>Victory!!</b>

00:07:37.140 --> 00:07:40.300
What do you think 
you're doing, you dumb mutt?!

00:07:41.630 --> 00:07:44.300
I'm the boss! I won't let 
you treat me that way!

00:07:44.300 --> 00:07:47.020
I never said I wanted to join a pack of dogs!

00:07:47.020 --> 00:07:48.980
I'm not a dog! I'm a wolf!

00:07:48.980 --> 00:07:50.740
Same difference!

00:07:50.740 --> 00:07:54.770
You keep talking about your pack, 
but it looks to me like...

00:07:54.770 --> 00:07:55.990
You're all alone!

00:07:56.220 --> 00:07:57.490
Alone

00:07:57.950 --> 00:08:00.650
Leave me out of your stupid "pack" game!

00:08:00.650 --> 00:08:01.790
Go away!

00:08:01.790 --> 00:08:02.980
Shoo, shoo!

00:08:07.750 --> 00:08:09.990
Uh... Now, listen.

00:08:09.990 --> 00:08:12.670
I'm a human, and you're a dog.

00:08:13.230 --> 00:08:14.380
Wolf...

00:08:14.690 --> 00:08:16.510
Just look at everyone else.

00:08:16.850 --> 00:08:19.010
They're all hanging out with their own kind.

00:08:19.010 --> 00:08:23.480
Animals of different species 
can't become friends.

00:08:24.260 --> 00:08:26.400
That's not true.

00:08:26.400 --> 00:08:31.450
A long time ago, there was 
a human who saved me!

00:08:32.570 --> 00:08:34.030
When I was little,

00:08:34.490 --> 00:08:36.280
I was attacked by bears...

00:08:36.670 --> 00:08:37.650
Stop!

00:08:38.280 --> 00:08:40.290
...and he showed up.

00:08:40.930 --> 00:08:44.600
He protected me with no regard 
for the danger he was in.

00:08:45.670 --> 00:08:50.300
No one outside my pack had ever done 
anything like that for me before.

00:08:50.300 --> 00:08:52.020
I was so happy.

00:08:53.140 --> 00:08:54.830
At the time, I thought

00:08:55.290 --> 00:08:59.560
that I might be able to make friends 
with animals other than wolves...

00:09:00.150 --> 00:09:04.520
That I might be able to form a pack 
with lots of different animals in it!

00:09:05.510 --> 00:09:06.440
Forget it!

00:09:06.440 --> 00:09:10.190
If you decide you want to join my 
pack later, I'm not letting you in!

00:09:12.690 --> 00:09:15.450
<b>Seton Academy  Student Dormitory</b>

00:09:18.200 --> 00:09:20.810
<i>When some bears were picking on me,</i>

00:09:20.810 --> 00:09:23.270
<i>a human boy showed up and saved me.</i>

00:09:23.690 --> 00:09:24.330
<i>No...</i>

00:09:24.950 --> 00:09:26.420
Stop!

00:09:26.420 --> 00:09:29.420
<i>That was me!</i>

00:09:29.730 --> 00:09:32.620
<i>I just stumbled across a puppy 
that was being picked on,</i>

00:09:32.620 --> 00:09:34.420
<i>and thought I'd help her out...</i>

00:09:34.420 --> 00:09:38.430
<i>But I ended up being beaten 
to a pulp by those bears.</i>

00:09:38.890 --> 00:09:42.060
<i>I've hated animals ever since.</i>

00:09:42.060 --> 00:09:44.560
<b>Se</b>

00:09:42.470 --> 00:09:47.310
<i>Then that stupid dog started licking 
my wounds, even though I told her to stop.</i>

00:09:47.670 --> 00:09:51.570
<i>That's when I knew I'd never share any 
kind of understanding with animals.</i>

00:09:52.190 --> 00:09:55.320
<i>I never thought I'd run into that mutt again.</i>

00:09:55.850 --> 00:10:00.530
That I might be able to form a pack 
with lots of different animals!

00:10:01.260 --> 00:10:03.990
Well, it's no concern of mine.

00:10:09.660 --> 00:10:11.590
<i>Seton Academy: Join the Pack!</i>

00:10:11.590 --> 00:10:14.000
<i>Tibetan wolf!</i>

00:10:14.610 --> 00:10:16.870
<i>Seton Academy: Join the Pack!</i>

00:10:16.870 --> 00:10:18.430
<i>Zebra!</i>

00:10:21.390 --> 00:10:23.890
Yeah! Break time!

00:10:23.890 --> 00:10:25.810
Damn animals...

00:10:25.810 --> 00:10:27.600
Good morning, Jin-kun.

00:10:27.600 --> 00:10:29.820
H-Hino-san?

00:10:32.270 --> 00:10:33.230
A club?

00:10:33.230 --> 00:10:36.230
Yeah. I was thinking of starting a cooking club.

00:10:36.230 --> 00:10:39.500
Oh, yeah. You did say you like to cook.

00:10:39.500 --> 00:10:40.350
Yeah.

00:10:40.350 --> 00:10:45.070
I thought it'd be nice to show 
other students how fun cooking is.

00:10:45.070 --> 00:10:46.780
I think it's a great idea!

00:10:46.780 --> 00:10:48.950
You could start a garden on the school grounds.

00:10:49.550 --> 00:10:50.870
That's jumping the gun a bit.

00:10:54.150 --> 00:10:57.130
<i>This is the beginning of my youth!</i>

00:10:58.660 --> 00:11:02.390
I told you! If you want Jin, 
you have to fight me, human female!

00:11:02.390 --> 00:11:04.460
Uh, um...

00:11:04.460 --> 00:11:07.470
And I told you that I don't 
want to be in your pack!

00:11:07.470 --> 00:11:09.530
As boss, I'm giving special permission to—

00:11:09.530 --> 00:11:10.230
Shut up!

00:11:10.700 --> 00:11:12.700
I'm talking to Hino-san right now!

00:11:12.700 --> 00:11:13.730
Can you not see that?!

00:11:16.610 --> 00:11:19.240
Are you in a pack with that female now?

00:11:19.240 --> 00:11:20.420
That's right!

00:11:21.370 --> 00:11:24.990
No, no, no! I meant since we were 
talking about starting a cooking club... um...

00:11:24.990 --> 00:11:27.670
A-Anyway! I'm not joining your pack!

00:11:27.670 --> 00:11:28.750
So beat it!

00:11:30.950 --> 00:11:32.070
Fine.

00:11:35.670 --> 00:11:36.910
Jin-kun...

00:11:36.910 --> 00:11:40.190
It's fine. She's really been bothering me.

00:11:46.640 --> 00:11:48.930
Are all of these yours?

00:11:48.930 --> 00:11:50.420
Sorry, are they too heavy?

00:11:50.420 --> 00:11:51.890
I can carry them...

00:11:51.890 --> 00:11:54.810
No, not at all. They're light.

00:12:03.280 --> 00:12:05.360
What is she doing?

00:12:05.360 --> 00:12:08.760
Check it out! That wolf's 
being put to work by a horse!

00:12:08.760 --> 00:12:09.790
Pathetic!

00:12:15.920 --> 00:12:17.420
Just what are you doing?

00:12:17.420 --> 00:12:20.340
If those get damaged, you will pay dearly.

00:12:21.300 --> 00:12:24.050
You're too slow, dog! Move faster!

00:12:24.050 --> 00:12:25.010
Hey!

00:12:25.100 --> 00:12:25.890
Stop!

00:12:25.890 --> 00:12:28.220
Don't hit her any more!

00:12:28.220 --> 00:12:31.170
Th-Those things look too heavy for Ranka-chan.

00:12:31.170 --> 00:12:34.030
Can't you carry at least a little of it yourself?

00:12:34.030 --> 00:12:36.110
I-It's fine, human female!

00:12:36.110 --> 00:12:38.760
No, it's not! This is...

00:12:38.760 --> 00:12:40.930
not the right way to 
make friends at all!

00:12:40.930 --> 00:12:42.570
You there...

00:12:42.570 --> 00:12:45.990
You dare defy the great Mashima Kuroe?

00:12:45.990 --> 00:12:48.590
I believe you just said 
something about "friends,"

00:12:48.590 --> 00:12:51.510
but this lone wolf, Ranka-san, 
begged me to let her join my herd,

00:12:51.510 --> 00:12:56.830
so I simply had no other choice 
but to let her join...

00:12:56.830 --> 00:12:58.630
as my pack horse!

00:13:00.300 --> 00:13:01.910
Don't call her a pack horse!

00:13:01.910 --> 00:13:04.130
It's all right, human female.

00:13:04.760 --> 00:13:08.970
This is my job as the newest 
member of the pack.

00:13:08.970 --> 00:13:12.490
There, you see? Just like I said!

00:13:12.490 --> 00:13:14.910
I'd rather have been in a pack with Jin, though.

00:13:14.910 --> 00:13:16.310
Excuse me?

00:13:16.770 --> 00:13:21.390
But Jin's starting a pack with that 
female... with Hitomi, right?

00:13:21.900 --> 00:13:24.590
I know how it feels to be all alone,

00:13:24.590 --> 00:13:28.870
so I'm happy that Jin gets to be 
in a pack with another human!

00:13:30.160 --> 00:13:31.790
Are you saying...

00:13:31.790 --> 00:13:35.020
you joined my herd even 
though you didn't want to?

00:13:35.020 --> 00:13:37.070
No! That's not what I meant!

00:13:37.070 --> 00:13:39.960
It appears you need some discipline!

00:13:42.420 --> 00:13:43.380
Jin!

00:13:42.420 --> 00:13:43.380
Jin-kun!

00:13:43.380 --> 00:13:45.550
How dare you?! This is not your concern!

00:13:45.550 --> 00:13:47.130
Is there a problem?

00:13:47.130 --> 00:13:51.050
You aren't in the same herd 
as Ranka-san, are... you...

00:13:53.060 --> 00:13:54.250
Hmph!

00:13:54.250 --> 00:13:55.850
That's it! You're fired!

00:13:55.850 --> 00:13:56.430
Huh?!

00:13:56.430 --> 00:13:59.170
I never thought Ranka-san 
was fit for a herd

00:13:59.170 --> 00:14:02.030
as proud and noble as that of the horses.

00:14:02.030 --> 00:14:04.470
What gives you the right to talk like that?

00:14:04.470 --> 00:14:05.450
It's because...

00:14:05.450 --> 00:14:07.130
...she's a zebra!

00:14:07.130 --> 00:14:10.060
Horse herds are plenty attractive 
and dignified on their own...

00:14:10.060 --> 00:14:13.540
...but she's the rarest 
among them, a horse with stripes!

00:14:13.540 --> 00:14:16.310
Indeed! I am a noble mare.

00:14:16.310 --> 00:14:19.420
I was ill-matched with you lot to begin with.

00:14:19.420 --> 00:14:21.000
Kuroe-sama!

00:14:22.570 --> 00:14:24.420
What are you talking about?

00:14:24.420 --> 00:14:26.260
Zebras are donkeys!

00:14:26.260 --> 00:14:28.220
Zebras are donkeys!

00:14:28.220 --> 00:14:30.660
Zebras are donkeys!

00:14:32.890 --> 00:14:34.080
Donkeys?

00:14:34.080 --> 00:14:36.060
They're not exactly the same,

00:14:36.060 --> 00:14:39.310
but zebras are more closely 
related to donkeys than horses.

00:14:36.100 --> 00:14:39.270
<b>Equines</b>

00:14:38.850 --> 00:14:45.420
<b>H
o
r
s
e</b>

00:14:38.850 --> 00:14:45.420
<b>Z
e
b
r
a</b>

00:14:39.310 --> 00:14:42.430
Horses are intelligent and friendly, 
so they get along well with humans,

00:14:42.430 --> 00:14:45.290
but zebras are short-tempered and 
don't get along with humans.

00:14:45.290 --> 00:14:47.940
Also, they communicate by barking.

00:14:45.840 --> 00:14:46.320
<b>Arf    Arf</b>

00:14:46.440 --> 00:14:46.940
<b>Arf    Arf</b>

00:14:47.070 --> 00:14:47.570
<b>Arf    Arf</b>

00:14:47.690 --> 00:14:47.940
<b>Arf    Arf</b>

00:14:47.940 --> 00:14:50.770
He's lying!

00:14:50.770 --> 00:14:53.270
Y-You mustn't let him fool you, everyone!

00:14:53.270 --> 00:14:55.390
This human just made all of that up!

00:14:55.390 --> 00:14:58.290
They're just lies with no proof to back them up!

00:14:58.290 --> 00:15:03.170
There's no way an elegant mare like 
myself belongs with the likes of them!

00:15:03.170 --> 00:15:05.010
You want me to show you proof?

00:15:05.010 --> 00:15:09.060
Oh, please do! If you have any, that is!

00:15:09.060 --> 00:15:10.500
Are you sure about that?

00:15:10.500 --> 00:15:13.180
Just show me already, you—

00:15:15.890 --> 00:15:16.590
See?

00:15:17.850 --> 00:15:20.540
Oh! It's only fluffy at the tip!

00:15:20.540 --> 00:15:22.270
I wondered why she never showed us...

00:15:22.270 --> 00:15:24.110
It's a donkey tail!

00:15:30.240 --> 00:15:33.490
Arf, arf, arf! I'll never accept this!

00:15:33.490 --> 00:15:34.930
Kuroe-sama!

00:15:34.930 --> 00:15:37.450
We don't mind it at all!

00:15:37.450 --> 00:15:38.620
Are you okay?

00:15:39.290 --> 00:15:42.040
Look what a mess you are, Ranka-chan.

00:15:50.450 --> 00:15:51.170
Ranka-chan?

00:15:52.390 --> 00:15:53.090
Hey!

00:16:08.820 --> 00:16:10.820
I finally found you.

00:16:11.450 --> 00:16:12.570
Where's Jin?

00:16:12.570 --> 00:16:13.650
On his way home.

00:16:14.940 --> 00:16:17.150
Wolves are proud creatures.

00:16:17.150 --> 00:16:18.860
I don't need your sympathy.

00:16:19.780 --> 00:16:21.330
Hey, Ranka-chan.

00:16:21.710 --> 00:16:24.290
Would you like to be my friend...

00:16:24.620 --> 00:16:26.460
and join the cooking club?

00:16:30.380 --> 00:16:31.170
Hitomi-chan?!

00:16:34.130 --> 00:16:37.370
Out of the way, runt.

00:16:37.370 --> 00:16:39.930
We're sick and tired of honey.

00:16:39.930 --> 00:16:43.310
We wanna play with that little cutie there.

00:16:43.310 --> 00:16:44.610
Shut up!

00:16:44.610 --> 00:16:46.810
Just give it up and go back to your den!

00:16:46.810 --> 00:16:51.220
"Shut up! Just give it up 
and go back to your den!"

00:16:51.220 --> 00:16:52.450
You hear that?

00:16:54.280 --> 00:16:57.260
Don't! You're going to get hurt, too!

00:16:57.260 --> 00:17:00.210
What did I tell you? Wolves are proud creatures!

00:17:00.210 --> 00:17:02.250
I'd disgrace us all if I let 
myself be saved all the time!

00:17:03.730 --> 00:17:06.370
And what are you to this little cutie?

00:17:06.370 --> 00:17:08.540
You're not in the same pack.

00:17:08.540 --> 00:17:10.750
I won't let you jerks have Hitomi!

00:17:10.750 --> 00:17:14.260
She only just started a pack with Jin!

00:17:14.260 --> 00:17:17.380
So you're defending someone else's pack?

00:17:17.380 --> 00:17:19.990
When you can't even find a pack of your own?

00:17:19.990 --> 00:17:21.510
I've heard of you.

00:17:21.930 --> 00:17:26.500
You've been going around begging other 
animals to let you join their packs.

00:17:26.500 --> 00:17:27.790
Pitiful!

00:17:27.790 --> 00:17:32.010
You even had a zebra put 
you to work and liked it!

00:17:33.530 --> 00:17:36.190
Look at that! She's gonna cry!

00:17:39.190 --> 00:17:41.160
Come with us!

00:17:40.030 --> 00:17:41.160
Hitomi!

00:17:43.010 --> 00:17:45.190
What a tasty-looking female!

00:17:45.190 --> 00:17:46.120
Yeah!

00:17:46.120 --> 00:17:48.170
S-Stop it!

00:17:49.230 --> 00:17:50.340
Hey!

00:17:50.650 --> 00:17:52.860
Cut it out, you worthless bears!

00:17:52.860 --> 00:17:53.320
Jin!

00:17:53.320 --> 00:17:53.920
Jin-kun!

00:17:53.920 --> 00:17:55.510
Hino-san, run!

00:17:55.510 --> 00:17:56.880
But...

00:17:57.510 --> 00:17:59.300
Now! Hurry!

00:17:59.300 --> 00:18:01.220
O-Okay!

00:18:04.130 --> 00:18:05.930
Yo, human.

00:18:05.930 --> 00:18:09.560
There ain't no place here for 
a weak primate like you.

00:18:14.340 --> 00:18:15.320
Hey, dumb dog!

00:18:18.570 --> 00:18:19.950
That voice...

00:18:19.950 --> 00:18:21.310
Jin!

00:18:21.810 --> 00:18:25.250
Cut it out, you dumb dog. 
All I did was help Hino-san.

00:18:25.250 --> 00:18:26.250
Jin!

00:18:26.250 --> 00:18:27.140
Bear claw!

00:18:30.210 --> 00:18:33.460
You've got a lot of nerve, 
mocking us like that.

00:18:33.460 --> 00:18:37.920
No way! He recovered from the 
bear spray that quickly?

00:18:37.920 --> 00:18:40.300
I washed it off with that!

00:18:40.300 --> 00:18:41.640
What?!

00:18:42.130 --> 00:18:44.760
I hope you're prepared.

00:18:44.760 --> 00:18:48.070
<i>The strongest of all predators, the Kodiak bear,</i>

00:18:48.070 --> 00:18:50.520
<i>stands three meters tall 
and weighs 500 kilograms.</i>

00:18:50.520 --> 00:18:52.390
<i>Their noses are five times 
keener than a dog's,</i>

00:18:52.390 --> 00:18:55.070
<i>and they can run as fast 
as 50 kilometers per hour.</i>

00:18:55.070 --> 00:18:58.830
<i>They're even tough enough to 
withstand being hit by a car.</i>

00:18:58.830 --> 00:19:00.210
Kodiak!

00:19:00.210 --> 00:19:00.930
Hey!

00:19:00.930 --> 00:19:01.700
<i>But...</i>

00:19:02.510 --> 00:19:06.680
<i>There is one animal that can 
snatch this bear's prey away:</i>

00:19:06.680 --> 00:19:08.290
<i>the wolf!</i>

00:19:08.290 --> 00:19:10.170
How dare you...

00:19:10.170 --> 00:19:12.650
How dare you threaten my friends?!

00:19:12.650 --> 00:19:15.550
<i>Wolves are not afraid of opponents 
that are larger than them.</i>

00:19:15.550 --> 00:19:16.710
You're kidding...

00:19:16.710 --> 00:19:20.770
<i>Wolves have even been known to prey upon bears!</i>

00:19:21.340 --> 00:19:24.010
<i>Only when they're in packs, though.</i>

00:19:25.690 --> 00:19:26.600
Dumb dog!

00:19:29.290 --> 00:19:30.990
Too bad for you!

00:19:37.400 --> 00:19:40.320
Do you guys wanna go extinct, too?

00:19:44.470 --> 00:19:46.120
Jin-kun! Ranka-chan!

00:19:46.890 --> 00:19:48.060
Are you okay?

00:19:48.570 --> 00:19:50.330
I get it! You went and got the teacher!

00:19:50.750 --> 00:19:52.580
Yeah. I'm so glad you're okay!

00:19:53.550 --> 00:19:55.580
Thanks, Hino-san.

00:20:02.270 --> 00:20:05.180
Hey. So you're still alone, huh?

00:20:05.180 --> 00:20:07.510
Leave me alone! What's it got to do with you?!

00:20:08.020 --> 00:20:10.060
Well, you know...

00:20:10.690 --> 00:20:13.150
Thanks for trying to save me.

00:20:13.970 --> 00:20:15.940
It might be a weird way to thank you,

00:20:16.630 --> 00:20:18.860
but I wouldn't mind joining your pack.

00:20:21.930 --> 00:20:22.820
That's nasty!

00:20:24.580 --> 00:20:27.120
I don't let people join my 
pack after they refuse—

00:20:27.120 --> 00:20:27.820
Never mind, then.

00:20:27.820 --> 00:20:28.990
I'll make an exception!

00:20:30.500 --> 00:20:33.100
<i>What made me decide to join her pack?</i>

00:20:33.770 --> 00:20:37.000
<i>I'd rather not get involved with 
any animals if I don't have to.</i>

00:20:37.000 --> 00:20:40.260
<i>But I guess I don't hate her... that much.</i>

00:20:41.340 --> 00:20:42.500
What the hell?

00:20:42.500 --> 00:20:44.010
You wanna join my pack, right?

00:20:44.450 --> 00:20:46.550
I welcome you, Jin!

00:20:49.150 --> 00:20:53.340
<i>The tendency of pet dogs to lick 
their owners around the mouth</i>

00:20:53.340 --> 00:20:57.230
<i>originated as a form of communication 
used by wolves with their packmates.</i>

00:20:58.010 --> 00:21:00.980
<i>It's used when a new member joins the pack</i>

00:21:00.980 --> 00:21:03.550
<i>and when interacting with an alpha male,</i>

00:21:03.550 --> 00:21:07.070
<i>and it expresses the highest level 
of affection and submission.</i>

00:21:07.070 --> 00:21:09.410
<i>But it can get very intense!</i>

00:21:09.410 --> 00:21:12.590
<i>And once a male and female wolf pair up,</i>

00:21:12.590 --> 00:21:14.560
<i>they spend their entire lives together!</i>

00:21:14.560 --> 00:21:15.370
Huh?!

00:21:15.370 --> 00:21:18.630
H-Hino-san, it's not what you think!

00:21:17.510 --> 00:21:19.750
I-I-I-I-I just remembered 
something I have to do!

00:21:19.750 --> 00:21:21.800
Hitomi!

00:21:21.800 --> 00:21:24.120
<i>It's used when a new member joins the pack</i>

00:21:24.120 --> 00:21:25.680
<i>and when interacting with an alpha male,</i>

00:21:26.010 --> 00:21:27.140
<i>and it expresses the highest level—</i>

00:21:27.140 --> 00:21:30.210
<i>In short, if a wolf licks you, you're a friend!</i>

00:21:30.210 --> 00:21:31.660
<i>Lick, lick!</i>

00:21:31.660 --> 00:21:33.180
Jin! Hitomi!

00:21:33.180 --> 00:21:35.940
Welcome to my pack!

00:21:59.980 --> 00:22:01.480
<b>Awoooo</b>

00:22:01.860 --> 00:22:03.480
<b>Awoooo</b>

00:23:08.190 --> 00:23:10.070
<b>Cooking Room</b>

00:23:08.710 --> 00:23:10.520
Okay, so...

00:23:10.520 --> 00:23:14.100
We're going to test you to see if 
you're good enough for the cooking club.

00:23:14.100 --> 00:23:15.160
Good luck!

00:23:15.160 --> 00:23:16.690
Okay! I'll—

00:23:16.690 --> 00:23:17.620
I'll do my best!

00:23:19.220 --> 00:23:20.620
Who are you?!

00:23:24.920 --> 00:23:25.630
<b>Next Time</b>

00:23:25.630 --> 00:23:27.150
<b>Ranka here!</b>

00:23:27.150 --> 00:23:28.780
<b>I'm Jin and Hitomi's boss!</b>

00:23:28.780 --> 00:23:30.280
<b>Hitomi and Jin started a cooking club.</b>

00:23:30.280 --> 00:23:31.900
<b>They're making me take a test to join it!</b>

00:23:31.900 --> 00:23:33.530
<b>But I'm their boss......</b>

00:23:33.530 --> 00:23:35.280
<b>Anyone who wants to join my club</b>

00:23:35.280 --> 00:23:36.530
<b>will be licked in welcome!</b>

00:23:36.530 --> 00:23:38.310
<b>See you next time!</b>

00:23:38.310 --> 00:23:40.250
<b>Seton Academy Record 2</b>

00:23:38.310 --> 00:23:40.250
<b>Why Females Put XXX in Their Mouths</b>
